<title>USA: Ontrack Data overallotment exercised.</title>
<headline>Ontrack Data overallotment exercised.</headline>
<dateline>EDEN PRAIRIE, Minn. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ontrack Data International Inc said that its underwriters exercised an overallotment option in connection with its recent public offering, resulting in the sale of 180,000 additional shares by Ontrack and 225,000 by certain selling shareholders.</p>
<p>The sale increases the total amount sold in the offering to 3,105,000 shares, consisting of 2,180,000 shares sold by Ontrack and 925,000 by other shareholders.</p>
<p>The offering began October 21 at an initial offering price of $12. Ontrack, which last traded at $13, provides data recovery services.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
